// the remainder (if the two points weren't equally far apart on both axes) in a straight run.
// That's the shortest possible route any combination of straight and diagonal wall pieces can
// take between two arbitrary points, and diagonal pieces only ever show up when they're
// actually shortening the route — an axis-aligned target still gets a plain straight wall.
// Shared by the actual build (handleVertexClick) and the hover preview (the shimmering line),
